Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.81,0:03:51.39,Default,,0000,0000,0008,,(O型阴性 高质量血液 通用血主){\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.55,0:05:57.30,Default,,0000,0000,0008,,《疯狂的麦克斯4：狂暴之路》
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.26,0:14:11.72,Default,,0000,0000,0008,,(我们的孩子绝不做军阀){\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.76,0:14:13.56,Default,,0000,0000,0008,,(谁杀死了世界){\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.15,0:17:50.94,Default,,0000,0000,0008,,(纳克斯){\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.05,0:19:01.14,Default,,0000,0000,0008,,战车在我们的地盘干什么{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.05,0:19:04.10,Default,,0000,0000,0008,,愚蠢… 自己送上门{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:07.19,1:53:20.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(我们该去什么地方 在这片废墟寻找更好的自己 史上第一人)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.28,0:00:21.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我叫麦克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My name is Max.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.98,0:00:25.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的世界充斥着火与血\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My world is fire and blood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.25,0:00:27.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么伤害这些人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why are you hurting these people?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.86,0:00:30.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 石油 蠢货 - 石油之战\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's the oil, stupid. - Oil wars.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.49,0:00:32.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我们为汽油杀人 - 汽油\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We are killing for guzzoline. - Guzzoline.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.43,0:00:34.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,世界上的水资源已经枯竭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The world is actually running out of water.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.41,0:00:36.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,水资源之战 水资源之战\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now there's the water wars, water wars.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.70,0:00:40.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我曾经是一名警察\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Once, I was a cop,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.33,0:00:43.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一位追寻正义的公路战士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A road warrior searching for a righteous cause.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.16,0:00:44.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,无可救药的疯狂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To the terminal freak-out point.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.96,0:00:47.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,人类已经失控 毛骨悚然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mankind has gone rogue, terrorizing itself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.27,0:00:49.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,热核之战\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thermonuclear skirmish.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.90,0:00:51.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,地球是酸臭的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The earth is sour.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.28,0:00:52.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,剧毒深入骨髓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our bones are poisoned.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.83,0:00:54.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们只剩半条命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have become half-life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.82,0:00:57.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,世界陨落之时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As the world fell...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.96,0:01:00.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,每个人都支离破碎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}each of us in our own way was broken.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.36,0:01:03.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很难分辨谁更疯狂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was hard to know who was more crazy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.46,0:01:09.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是我 还是其他人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}me or everyone else.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.52,0:01:13.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.30,0:01:17.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你在哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.26,0:01:26.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你在哪 麦克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are you Max?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.44,0:01:28.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 他们又来了 - 麦克斯·洛克坦斯基\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Here they come again. - Max rockatansky.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.64,0:01:31.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,蠕动着侵入我大脑内的黑暗深渊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Worming their way into the black matter of my brain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.04,0:01:32.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,救救我们 麦克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help us Max!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.89,0:01:34.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你保证会救我们的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You promised to help us!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.49,0:01:39.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我告诉自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I tell myself...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.57,0:01:41.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们无法伤害我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}they cannot touch me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.60,0:01:45.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们早就死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They are long dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.05,0:02:19.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,跟着他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}After him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.73,0:02:22.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,跟着他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}After him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.28,0:02:29.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,动手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.29,0:02:48.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我逃离活人 也逃离亡魂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am the one who runs from both the living and the dead,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.58,0:02:51.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,被秃鹫捕猎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hunted by scavengers...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.76,0:02:55.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,被我辜负的冤魂纠缠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Haunted by those I could not protect.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.09,0:03:07.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我在这片废墟里挣扎…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So I exist in this wasteland...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.49,0:03:16.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,人性中只剩下一个本能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A man, reduced to a single instinct:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.29,0:03:18.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,活下去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Survive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.82,0:04:40.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,麦克斯 ？麦克斯 ？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Max? Max?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.27,0:04:41.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是你吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.78,0:04:42.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你去哪了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where were you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.32,0:04:47.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 救救我们 - 你去哪了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Help us. - Where were you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.17,0:04:47.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,救救我们 麦克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help us, Max.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.70,0:04:48.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你去哪了 麦克斯 - 救救我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where were you, Max? - Help us!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.25,0:05:06.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,救救我们 麦克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help us, Max.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.34,0:05:07.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别跑了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop running.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.28,0:05:10.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你害死了我们 - 你害死了我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You let us die. - You let us die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.24,0:05:12.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你害死了我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You let us die!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.50,0:05:13.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你害死了我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You let us die!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.28,0:05:16.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你保证会救我们的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You promised to help us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.12,0:05:16.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.68,0:05:37.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,见证我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Witness!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.28,0:06:32.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们是战争男孩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are war boys!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.29,0:06:33.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,战争男孩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}War boys!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.34,0:06:35.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,勇猛战争男孩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kamakrazee war boys!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.39,0:06:36.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,战争男孩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}War boys!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.46,0:06:40.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,狂暴勇猛战争男孩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fucacima kamakrazee war boys!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.34,0:06:41.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,钩上去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hooked on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.13,0:06:45.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,今天我们要去汽油镇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Today we're headin' to gas town!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.85,0:06:46.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,汽油镇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gas town!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.08,0:06:49.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们要拖走可乐水\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Today we're haulin' aqua cola.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.81,0:06:51.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可乐水\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aqua cola!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.85,0:06:53.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们要拖走农作物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Today we're haulin' produce!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.09,0:06:55.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,农作物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Produce!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.12,0:06:57.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们还要拖走乳汁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And today we're haulin' mother's milk!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.64,0:06:59.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乳汁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mother's milk!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.98,0:07:28.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔 乔 乔 不死老乔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Joe! Joe! Joe! Immortan Joe!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.21,0:07:51.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,欢呼不死老乔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rev it up for the immortan Joe!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.66,0:08:02.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我再次派出战车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Once again, we send off my war rig{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.04,0:08:06.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,从汽油镇带回汽油\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to bring back guzzoline from gas town{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.44,0:08:08.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,从子弹农场带回子弹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and bullets from the bullet farm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.89,0:08:15.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我再次向我的猛将弗里莎致敬\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Once again, I salute my imperator, furiosa!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.62,0:08:19.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我向半条命战争男孩致敬\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I salute my half-life war boys{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.68,0:08:22.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们将随我一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who will ride with me eternal{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.40,0:08:24.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,前往永生的英灵殿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}on the highways of Valhalla.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.97,0:08:27.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,冲锋 冲锋 冲锋 冲锋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Assault! Assault! Assault!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.44,0:08:30.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是你们的救世主\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am your redeemer!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.50,0:08:37.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,追随我 你们将从这片尘土中崛起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is by my hand you will rise from the ashes of this world!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.75,0:08:47.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要来了 快准备\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's comin'. G-get ready.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.19,0:08:51.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太好了 要来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes. Yes. Yes. It's comin'.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.72,0:09:53.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,臣民们 不要沉迷于水\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do not, my friends, become addicted to water.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.45,0:09:55.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,它会控制你们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It will take hold of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.36,0:09:58.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让你们憎恶它的缺失\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you will resent its absence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.12,0:10:26.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,滚开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Clear off!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.22,0:10:28.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,把他们弄走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get 'em all off!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.50,0:10:29.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快滚开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Clear off!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.45,0:10:41.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,给汽油镇发讯号 车队出发了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Signal gas town. Convoy's on its way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.85,0:11:11.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有一个战争男孩快没血了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got a war boy runnin' on empty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.09,0:11:13.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,把那个满血的吊起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hook up that full-life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.78,0:11:20.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 小心点 那可是个万能输血者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey! Careful. That's a universal donor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.50,0:12:18.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老大 我们不去汽油镇吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Boss, we're not going to Gas Town?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.10,0:12:22.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,子弹农场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bullet Farm?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.01,0:12:27.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们向东走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're heading east!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.32,0:12:30.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我把话传下去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll pass it down the line.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.21,0:12:33.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,新命令\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}New orders!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.81,0:12:35.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,打起精神来 打起精神来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thunder up! Thunder up!{\r}
