Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.09,0:12:40.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 走 走 - 王牌 怎么回事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Go. Go. Go. - Ace, what's going on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.02,0:12:42.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我们向东走 - 为什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We're heading east. - Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.25,0:12:44.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道 这是命令\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know. That's the order.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.52,0:13:03.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Moo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.28,0:13:04.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 嘿 老爹 - 嗯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hey, pa. - Hm?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.69,0:13:05.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know about this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.85,0:13:09.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的车队没去汽油镇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your produce ain't going to gas town.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.30,0:13:20.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她偏离了路线\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's gone off-road...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.49,0:13:22.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,去敌方地盘上了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Into hostile territory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.54,0:13:26.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她为什么要这么做 老爹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why would she do that, dad?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.05,0:13:30.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让我看看 让我看看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me see. Let me see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.10,0:13:31.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 裂齿 - 我想看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Rictus. - I wanna see!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.54,0:13:34.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,咧嘴 去看看老爹为什么生气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rictus, go see what's agitating dad!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.69,0:14:03.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,绚丽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Splendid!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.53,0:14:06.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,安哈拉德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Angharad!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.72,0:14:17.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她们在哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are they?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.88,0:14:19.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她们不是你的所有物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They are not your property.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.97,0:14:21.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,吉迪小姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Miss giddy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.26,0:14:23.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你无法拥有一个人类\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You cannot own a human being.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.93,0:14:26.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,总有一天有人会反抗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sooner or later someone pushes back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.38,0:14:28.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她要把她们带去哪里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is she taking them?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.85,0:14:31.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她没带她们走 是她们求她的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She didn't take them. They begged her to go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.17,0:14:34.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她要把她们带去哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is she taking them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.82,0:14:36.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,远离你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A long way from you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.00,0:15:03.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, what's happening?{\r}
