Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.92,0:15:09.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,发生了什么 撕裂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's going on? Slit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.78,0:15:12.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,叛国 背叛 一个主将叛逃了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Treason, betrayal, an imperator gone rogue.{\r}
