Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.69,0:15:17.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她从不死老乔那带走了很多东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She took a lot of stuff from immortan Joe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.69,0:15:18.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}W-what stuff?{\r}
