Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.81,0:15:20.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他最优质的孕育者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His prize breeders.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.01,0:15:23.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他要她们毫发无损地回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He wants them back. Not a hand laid on 'em.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.60,0:15:33.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,以我之功绩敬仰他 八缸战车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}By my deeds, I honor him. V-8.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.91,0:15:46.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是我的方向盘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's my wheel.{\r}
