Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.54,0:15:52.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,今天不行 今天是属于我的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not today. Today is my day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.56,0:15:53.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看看你自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at you!{\r}
