Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.02,0:15:58.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不要待在这里 碌碌无为地死去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not staying here dying a sloth!{\r}
