Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.41,0:16:03.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我只是需要一点补给 - 没时间了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I just need a little top-up. - There's no time!{\r}
