Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.57,0:16:35.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right-o.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.26,0:16:44.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太棒了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.66,0:16:47.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们到底还想夺走我多少东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah! How much more can they take from me?{\r}
