Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.39,0:17:44.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他只是在环视周围\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was scanning the horizon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.94,0:17:45.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
