Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.84,0:19:22.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,右方有秃鹰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Buzzards right!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.85,0:19:23.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,注意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eyes on!{\r}
