Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.28,0:57:00.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,前往英灵殿之门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to the gates of Valhalla.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.18,0:57:01.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我被选中了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Am I awaited?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.42,0:57:06.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你会永垂不朽 闪耀而美丽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You will ride eternal... shiny and chrome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.65,0:57:09.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,裂齿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rictus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.56,0:57:11.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,帮他上车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help him aboard!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:13.78,0:57:14.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,准备好了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ready?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.57,0:57:16.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,去吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here we go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.88,0:57:30.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,庸才\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mediocre!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.37,0:58:01.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,臭屌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Schlanger!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:21.74,0:58:22.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:26.12,0:58:27.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,安哈拉德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Angharad!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:27.81,0:58:28.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快下车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:50.08,0:58:51.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不 安哈拉德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! Angharad!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:06.92,0:59:08.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,停下 快掉头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop! Turn the rig around!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:10.13,0:59:11.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,回去救她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go back for her!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:12.97,0:59:13.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:14.04,0:59:15.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,和他说 让他掉头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell him to turn the rig around!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:15.86,0:59:16.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你看见了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you see it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:17.50,0:59:18.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她被轮子碾过去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She went under the wheels.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.69,0:59:20.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你看见了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you see it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.66,0:59:24.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她被车轮碾过去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She went under the wheels.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.69,0:59:26.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们继续前进\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We keep moving.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:26.82,0:59:28.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 不 - 我们继续前进\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No! - We keep moving!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:28.45,0:59:30.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他不知道自己在说什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He doesn't know what he's talking about!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.18,0:59:33.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不管发生什么 我们都要去绿洲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whatever happens, we're going to the green place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.22,0:59:34.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那该死的绿洲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The stupid green place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:34.48,0:59:36.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们甚至不知道它在哪里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We don't even know where to find it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.37,0:59:49.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你没事吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:49.18,0:59:50.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,继续追\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On! On!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.01,1:00:29.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,绮朵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cheedo!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:30.76,1:00:32.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,绮朵 别犯傻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cheedo, don't be stupid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:32.29,1:00:35.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 停下 - 他会原谅我们的 一定会的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Stop! - He'll forgive us. I know he will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:35.03,1:00:36.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有回头路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is no going back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.63,1:00:37.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们是他的珍宝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We were his treasures!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:38.00,1:00:39.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 绮朵 - 我们被他呵护\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Cheedo! - We were protected.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:39.80,1:00:41.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他给我们最好的待遇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He gave us the high life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:41.12,1:00:43.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 那有什么错 - 我们不是物品\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What wrong with that? - We are not things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.44,1:00:45.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:46.85,1:00:48.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,绮朵 我们不是物品\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cheedo, we are not things!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.46,1:00:49.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们不是物品\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are not things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:49.73,1:00:51.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不想再听到这句话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't want to hear that again!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:51.18,1:00:52.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是她说的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They were her words!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:52.25,1:00:53.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在她死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And now she's dead!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:55.21,1:00:56.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,无论你如何痛苦挣扎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wring your hands and tear your hair,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:58.52,1:00:59.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你都不能回到他身边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not going back to him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:00.17,1:01:01.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,安哈拉德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Angharad!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:01.58,1:01:02.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,起来 起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on! Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:20.89,1:01:21.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以 呃…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, um...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:23.77,1:01:24.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这个…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is this...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.74,1:01:27.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,绿洲在哪里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This green place?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.53,1:01:31.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,向东行驶一整晚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a long night's run, heading east.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:34.04,1:01:35.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们需要子弹清单\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need inventory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:35.52,1:01:37.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要你把每把枪的子弹对上号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want you to match every gun with its bullets.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.69,1:01:43.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我下去做些修理\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna go down and do some repairs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:43.83,1:01:45.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,后面需要一个人放哨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need someone down the back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.46,1:01:47.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我去 - 不行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'll go. - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:47.36,1:01:48.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们待在一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want you to stay together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:49.73,1:01:50.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我可以的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.12,1:02:25.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你在这里做什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:26.64,1:02:27.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他看见了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He saw it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:28.54,1:02:29.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他什么都看见了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He saw it all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:31.32,1:02:33.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的血袋开着战车杀死了她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My own blood bag drivin' the rig that killed her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:41.72,1:02:43.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快停下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop doing that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:44.32,1:02:45.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘘 嘘 嘘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shh, shh, shh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:46.45,1:02:47.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,停下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:57.46,1:03:00.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大门曾向我敞开了三次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thr... three times the gates were open to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:00.81,1:03:01.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么大门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What gates?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:02.56,1:03:03.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我被英灵殿召唤了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was awaited in Valhalla.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:04.41,1:03:05.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们在呼唤我的名字\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They were calling my name.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:06.84,1:03:08.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我本可以随不死神一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I should be walking with the immorta,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:08.52,1:03:10.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,与诸代先烈畅怀豪饮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}mcfeasting with the heroes of all time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:14.08,1:03:16.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也许你的命运并非如此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd say it was your manifest Destiny not to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.94,1:03:21.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我以为我终于得到了一些美好的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought I was being spared for something great.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.72,1:03:24.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我开上了追捕车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got to drive a pursuit vehicle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:26.13,1:03:28.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有一阵子 甚至拉瑞和巴瑞都不再折磨我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For a while even Larry and Barry stopped chewing on my windpipe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:29.54,1:03:30.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谁是拉瑞和巴瑞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who are Larry and Barry?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.09,1:03:32.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的伙伴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My mates.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:33.93,1:03:34.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拉瑞和巴瑞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Larry and Barry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.26,1:03:39.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就算它们没杀死我 夜热也会要了我的命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If they don't get me, then the night fevers will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:04.34,1:04:07.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这把大家伙只剩四颗子弹了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, we've only got four for big boy here,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.06,1:04:08.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以它基本报废了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so he's all but useless.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:09.65,1:04:13.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我们还能用这把小家伙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But we can squirt off this little pinky{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.29,1:04:14.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,射二十九次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a raunchy 29 times.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:17.42,1:04:19.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,安哈拉德以前管它叫叛逆之种\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Angharad used to call them Anti-seed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:20.56,1:04:22.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,种下一颗 收获死亡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Plant one and watch something die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:57.96,1:06:01.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们损失了三万升汽油\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are down 30,000 units of guzzoline,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:01.32,1:06:05.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,十九罐氮气 十二辆攻击型摩托\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}19 canisters of nitro, 12 assault bikes,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:05.32,1:06:06.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,七辆追捕车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}7 pursuit vehicles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:07.05,1:06:08.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,亏损严重\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The deficit mounts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.38,1:06:12.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在 阁下 你又害我们陷进了泥潭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And now, sir, you have us stuck in a quagmire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.30,1:06:13.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 老乔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Joe!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:15.36,1:06:15.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Boss!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:18.54,1:06:20.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的女人快不行了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your girly's breathing her last!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.30,1:06:22.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那孩子呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about the child?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:32.34,1:06:33.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你来不来 兄弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are ya comin', brother?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:34.02,1:06:34.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:36.48,1:06:38.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,里面什么动静都没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's gone awful quiet in there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:38.28,1:06:39.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,取出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get it out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:39.68,1:06:40.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,把他取出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get it out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:43.81,1:06:45.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快点 我等不及要去折磨叛徒了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on! I've been called to the torture!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:46.98,1:06:48.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,耐心点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Patience!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:49.34,1:06:51.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你就待在这里伤心吧 老爹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, you stay here with your grief, daddy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:52.30,1:06:53.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我去帮你抓他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll fetch 'em for ya.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:53.56,1:06:55.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小心点 别损坏我的财产\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Be careful! Protect the assets!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:58.02,1:06:59.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只需要一颗子弹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just one angry shot...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:00.85,1:07:02.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,杀死弗里莎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For furiosa.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.65,1:07:03.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,出发\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hut!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:11.29,1:07:12.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真可惜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cryin' shame.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:16.33,1:07:17.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,再过一个月\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Another month...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:18.22,1:07:19.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也许就是个健康的孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Could've been your viable human.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.14,1:07:21.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是男孩吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Was it a male?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:21.73,1:07:23.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是个小男子汉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your a-one Alpha prime.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:24.97,1:07:27.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 裂齿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, rictus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:29.21,1:07:30.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你失去了一个小弟弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You lost a baby brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.33,1:07:34.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而且身体健全\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perfect in every way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:37.89,1:07:39.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我有过一个弟弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I had a baby brother!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:39.88,1:07:41.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我有过一个小弟弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I had a little baby brother!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:42.00,1:07:43.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他很完美\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And he was perfect!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:43.99,1:07:45.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,完美无缺\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perfect in every way!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:16.66,1:08:17.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:27.28,1:08:28.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别射到那些女人 老大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wouldn't wanna shoot the wives, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:29.04,1:08:30.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只是探探路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just probing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:41.69,1:08:43.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他想帮忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He wants to help!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:43.40,1:08:44.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:44.58,1:08:45.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那个战争男孩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The war boy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:45.98,1:08:47.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他从哪冒出来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where did he come from?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:47.14,1:08:49.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我以为我们把他扔下车了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought we threw him off the rig!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:53.69,1:08:55.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那个东西后面有一个高地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}T-there's high ground just beyond that thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:55.81,1:08:56.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他是说那棵树\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He means the tree.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:57.03,1:08:58.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对 树\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. Tree!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:00.36,1:09:00.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我来盯着他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Leave him to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:00.90,1:09:02.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有人注意到那道亮光了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Say, anyone notice that bright light?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:02.88,1:09:04.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有人在向我们开火吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Encroaching gunfire?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:05.34,1:09:07.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 出来 - 我可以的 我了解这辆车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Get out. - I-I can do this. I know this machine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:07.52,1:09:08.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,的确 他是驾驶员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He does. He's a revhead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:14.89,1:09:16.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你还剩两发子弹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've got two left.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:22.28,1:09:22.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,盯着他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:41.04,1:09:42.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,屏住呼吸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't breathe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.73,1:09:47.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.38,1:09:49.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 嘿 战争男孩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey! Hey! War boy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.17,1:09:52.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我去把铰链缠在那个树上面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna use the winch 'round the tree thing!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:53.74,1:09:56.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拿着枪 我们去拿引擎板\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take this. Let's get the engine plates.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:58.14,1:09:59.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你去开车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You drive the rig!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:59.42,1:10:01.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 举起火炬 - 我正举着火炬\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hold up a flare. - I am holding a flare!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:01.89,1:10:02.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,再近点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Closer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:02.42,1:10:04.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就在你眼前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's right in front of your eyes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:16.49,1:10:18.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,出发 出发\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hut! Hut!!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:24.70,1:10:25.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,血袋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Blood bag!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:32.17,1:10:34.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是正义的使者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am the scales of justice!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:35.06,1:10:37.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,死亡的掌控者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Conductor of the choir of death!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:42.14,1:10:43.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,惨叫吧 叛徒们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sing, brother Koch!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:46.87,1:10:48.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,惨叫吧 叛徒 惨叫吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sing, brothers, sing!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:49.14,1:10:50.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,惨叫吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sing!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.44,1:10:52.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,难道他们不知道会打到我们吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't they know they're shooting at us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:07.40,1:11:08.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,枪林热弹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gun fever!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:19.02,1:12:20.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我从没想过自己能做如此厉害的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I never thought I'd do something as shine as that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:21.74,1:12:22.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,引擎怎么样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How are the engines?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:23.93,1:12:25.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,过烫 而且需要加油\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Very hot and real thirsty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:30.18,1:12:30.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:31.52,1:12:34.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你把战车沿着路向下开半公里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You need to take the war rig half a click down the track.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:35.40,1:12:36.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要是引擎冷却之后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What if you're not back{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:36.22,1:12:37.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你还没回来怎么办\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}by the time the engines have cooled?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:40.50,1:12:41.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们继续前进\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, you keep moving.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:51.50,1:12:53.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得他想做什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you suppose he's gonna do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:54.56,1:12:55.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,以血还血\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Retaliate first.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.50,1:13:00.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:20.54,1:14:21.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你受伤了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you hurt?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:21.62,1:14:22.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.42,1:14:24.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你在流血\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're bleeding.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:25.22,1:14:26.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那不是他的血\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's not his blood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:28.52,1:14:29.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:30.93,1:14:32.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是乳汁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's mother's milk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:14.57,1:15:15.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没事的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:15.94,1:15:16.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,睡吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sleep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:18.06,1:15:19.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好好休息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get some rest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:30.06,1:15:32.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么知道那地方真的存在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do you know this place even exists?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:35.32,1:15:36.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我出生在那里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was born there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:39.14,1:15:40.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那你为什么离开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So why'd you leave?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:40.65,1:15:41.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:43.29,1:15:45.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我小时候被带走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was taken as a child.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:46.97,1:15:47.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,被偷走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stolen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:54.21,1:15:55.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你以前做过这种事吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You done this before?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:56.60,1:15:57.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很多次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Many times.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:58.97,1:16:00.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在我开战车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now that I drive a war rig...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:02.85,1:16:04.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是我最好的机会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is the best shot I'll ever have.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:06.08,1:16:06.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那她们呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:09.24,1:16:10.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她们在寻找希望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're looking for hope.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:11.86,1:16:12.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那你呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:18.65,1:16:19.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,救赎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Redemption.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:03.37,1:17:05.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 那是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, what's that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:18.53,1:17:20.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我曾见过那样的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I remember something like that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:33.08,1:17:34.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,救救我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:37.26,1:17:38.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,救救我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:42.64,1:17:43.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,救救我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help me, please!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:46.17,1:17:47.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是诱饵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's bait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:48.73,1:17:49.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,待在车里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay in the rig.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:55.33,1:17:57.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快点 求求你 他们快回来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hurry! Please, hurry! They'll be back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:59.61,1:18:01.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是乌乌里尼的族人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm one of the Vuvalini!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:02.77,1:18:04.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,众母之女\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of the Many Mothers!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:06.29,1:18:09.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的启蒙母亲是凯蒂·肯嘉尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My initiate mother was Katie Concannon!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:10.62,1:18:13.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是玛丽·杰巴萨的女儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am the daughter of Mary Jabassa.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:14.46,1:18:16.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是幼犬家族的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My clan was swaddle dog!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:04.62,1:19:05.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:14.01,1:19:15.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她的这种眼神\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's something in the eyes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:16.20,1:19:17.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也许她真的是杰巴萨的孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perhaps it is Jabassa's child.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:23.54,1:19:25.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是我们的弗里莎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is our furiosa.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:27.84,1:19:28.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有多久了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How long has it been?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:30.93,1:19:32.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,七千天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}7,000 days.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:32.96,1:19:34.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有那些我尚未记事的日子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Plus the ones I don't remember.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:36.37,1:19:37.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,弗里莎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Furiosa.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:38.94,1:19:40.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你母亲怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What happened to your mother?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:41.98,1:19:42.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She died.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:44.17,1:19:45.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在我出生后的第三天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On the third day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:52.70,1:19:53.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你从哪里来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}From where did you come?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:54.42,1:19:56.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,西边 末日堡垒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The west. Citadel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:56.80,1:19:57.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在群山后面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Beyond the mountains.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:02.41,1:20:03.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那些男人 他们是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The men... who are they?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:04.77,1:20:05.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们可以信任\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're reliable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:06.44,1:20:07.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们帮我们来到这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They helped us get here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:20.06,1:20:21.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你从哪找来这些尤物的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where did you find such creatures?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:24.77,1:20:25.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真柔软\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So soft.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:26.78,1:20:28.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这个牙齿长得真好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This one has all her teeth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:37.38,1:20:38.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我等不及想让他们看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't wait for them to see it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:40.10,1:20:40.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:42.36,1:20:43.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:43.90,1:20:44.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,家园\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:49.11,1:20:50.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,绿洲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The green place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:50.85,1:20:52.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但如果你们从西边来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But if you came from the west,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:54.08,1:20:55.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,应该会路过那里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you passed it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:56.88,1:20:57.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乌鸦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The crows.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:58.73,1:21:00.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,令人毛骨悚然的群鸦之地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The creepy place with all the crows.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:02.25,1:21:03.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,土壤污染\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The soil.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:03.14,1:21:03.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们只能背井离乡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We had to get out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:03.86,1:21:05.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我们没有水 - 水肮脏无比\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We had no water and... - the water was filth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:05.78,1:21:09.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 被污染了 都是酸臭的 - 然后乌鸦来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It was poisoned. It was sour. - And the crows came.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:09.36,1:21:10.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们无法耕种\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We couldn't grow anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:11.42,1:21:12.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,其他人在哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are the others?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:13.00,1:21:13.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么其他人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What others?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:14.10,1:21:15.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,众母\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The many mothers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:15.60,1:21:16.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们是幸存的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're the only ones left.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:17.98,1:22:18.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:21.93,1:22:23.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那就是你们口中的卫星\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's what you call a satellite.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:24.92,1:22:26.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,吉迪小姐告诉我们的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Miss giddy told us about those.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:27.78,1:22:29.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,它们曾用于为地球传送信号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They used to bounce messages across the earth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:31.22,1:22:32.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,电视节目\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shows.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:33.13,1:22:35.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,曾经的世界里每个人都有节目\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everyone in the old world had a show.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:37.80,1:22:39.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得现在还有人在那里吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you think there's still somebody out there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:41.33,1:22:42.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,播送节目\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sending shows?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:43.32,1:22:44.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谁知道呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who knows?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:45.72,1:22:47.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是一片寂静荒原\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Those are the plains of silence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:50.53,1:22:52.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乖乖待着别动 小乔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay right where you are, little Joe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:52.82,1:22:54.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,外面的世界越发无趣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kind of lost its novelty out here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:55.18,1:22:56.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你怀孕了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You having a baby?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:57.93,1:22:58.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,军阀的孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Warlord Jr.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:59.57,1:23:00.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,肯定很丑陋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gonna be so ugly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:01.50,1:23:02.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也许是个女孩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It could be a girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:04.89,1:23:06.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你用那把抢杀人 对吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You kill people with that, do ya?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:06.64,1:23:08.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我杀了所有从外面来的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Killed everyone I ever met out here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:09.00,1:23:09.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一枪爆头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Headshots, all of 'em.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:10.10,1:23:11.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,正中脑髓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Snap. Right in the medulla.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:11.72,1:23:13.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我以为你们早就不这么暴力了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thought somehow you girls were above all that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:18.12,1:23:18.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:27.14,1:23:28.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来瞧瞧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take a peek.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:28.88,1:23:30.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,种子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Seeds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:31.22,1:23:32.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这些是家乡的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These are from home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:32.96,1:23:34.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,传家宝 真正的种子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Heirlooms. The real thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:35.76,1:23:37.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一有机会 我就种一颗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I plant one every chance I get.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:37.88,1:23:38.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,种在哪里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:39.26,1:23:41.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,至今没一株能活 土壤太酸了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So far, nothing's took. Earth's too sour.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:42.46,1:23:44.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,种类好多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah, so many different kinds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:44.58,1:23:46.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,树 花朵 水果\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Trees, flowers, fruit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:47.57,1:23:49.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当时 每个人都有一份\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Back then, everyone had their fill.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:50.44,1:23:52.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当年 我们不必为生存杀人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Back then, there was no need to snap anybody.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:08.42,1:24:09.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我能和你谈谈吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can I talk to you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:29.25,1:24:30.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我和其他人谈过了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've talked with the others.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:38.00,1:24:40.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们再也不会有更好的机会 穿过这片盐碱地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're never gonna have a better chance to make it across the salt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:43.28,1:24:44.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果我们把战车留在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If we leave the rig here{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:45.04,1:24:47.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,尽量给摩托车加满汽油\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and load the motorcycles up with as much as we can,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:47.70,1:24:49.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们也许能开一百六十天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we can maybe ride for 160 days.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:52.97,1:24:54.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,其中一辆摩托是你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One of those bikes is yours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:56.06,1:24:56.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,加满了油\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fully loaded.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:00.38,1:25:02.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们很欢迎你加入我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're more than welcome to come with us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:06.46,1:25:08.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我 我走自己的路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll... I'll make my own way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:15.18,1:25:16.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,希望是一种错误\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, hope is a mistake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:24.11,1:25:26.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你无法修补裂纹 你会…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you can't fix what's broken, you'll, uh...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:29.45,1:25:30.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你会变成疯子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you'll go insane.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:47.20,1:25:48.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你在哪 麦克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are you, Max?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:50.97,1:25:51.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你在哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:52.94,1:25:53.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 救救我 - 救救我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Help me. - Help us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:54.01,1:25:55.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你保证会救我们的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You promised to help us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:06.25,1:26:08.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快点 爸爸 我们走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, pa. Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:40.49,1:26:41.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:42.84,1:26:44.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是你回家的路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is your way home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:48.57,1:26:49.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们回去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We go back?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:51.87,1:26:53.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 回去 - 是啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Back? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:53.97,1:26:55.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我以为你不再是疯子了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought you weren't insane anymore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:55.76,1:26:57.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们在说什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are they saying?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:57.32,1:26:59.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他想回到他们来的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He wants to go back from where they came.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:59.73,1:27:00.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,末日堡垒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The citadel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:02.00,1:27:03.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,末日堡垒里有什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's there to find at the Citadel?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:04.02,1:27:04.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,绿洲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Green.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:05.57,1:27:06.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有水源\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And water.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:08.20,1:27:10.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那里有大量干净的水\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is a ridiculous amounts of clear water.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:10.85,1:27:11.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,以及许多粮食\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And a lot of crops.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:11.94,1:27:14.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一切应有尽有 只要你不恐高\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's got everything you need, as long as you're not afraid of heights.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:14.74,1:27:15.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,水是从哪来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where does the water come from?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:15.81,1:27:17.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他从地底深处抽上来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He pumps it out from deep under the earth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:17.69,1:27:20.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,称之为"可乐水" 并据为己有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Calls it "Aqua Cola", and claims it all for himself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:20.38,1:27:22.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为他拥有水 他就拥有我们所有人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And because he owns it, he owns all of us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:22.54,1:27:23.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我已经讨厌他了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't like him already.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:24.16,1:27:26.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,翻过群山需要花两周\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It'll take two weeks just to scale a wall of mountains.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:26.74,1:27:27.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:28.04,1:27:30.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们原路返回\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I suggest we go back the same way we came.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:32.21,1:27:33.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,穿过峡谷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Through the canyon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:34.82,1:27:36.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在已经畅通无阻了 对吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's open. We know that. Right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:37.13,1:27:38.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他带领军队从那里通过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He brought all his war parties through!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:39.32,1:27:41.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们开战车向他们冲过去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So we take the war rig and we charge it{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:41.10,1:27:42.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,冲到他们中间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}right through the middle of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:42.73,1:27:44.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们在道口卸下油罐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can decouple the tanker at the pass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:45.80,1:27:47.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,封住后路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shut it off behind us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:47.50,1:27:48.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kaboom!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:51.57,1:27:53.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们要怎样夺取末日堡垒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And how exactly do we take the Citadel?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:54.54,1:27:56.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,假设到时候我们还活着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Assuming we're still alive by then?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:56.78,1:27:58.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果我们能堵住路 那就简单了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If we can block the pass, it'll be easy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:59.46,1:28:00.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那里只剩下老弱病残\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All that's left are his war pups{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:01.37,1:28:02.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,以及病弱的战争男孩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and war boys too sick to fight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:04.01,1:28:07.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们还有纳克斯 他是战争男孩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And we'll be with nux. He's a war boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:07.44,1:28:08.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他会带我们回家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He'll be bringing us home,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:08.45,1:28:10.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,夺回属于我们的东西 这是他的使命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}bringing back what's stolen, as he's meant to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:13.84,1:28:14.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:15.97,1:28:16.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听上去像希望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It feels like hope.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:18.80,1:28:19.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我喜欢这个计划\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I like this plan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:20.36,1:28:21.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们可以重新开始\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can start again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:22.58,1:28:23.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如同昔日一般\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just like the old days.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:25.78,1:28:29.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听着 这会是艰难的一天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, it'll be a hard day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:30.03,1:28:32.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我保证 你向那条路骑一百六十天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I guarantee you that 160 days ridin' that way,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:35.36,1:28:36.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,仍是一片荒凉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}there's nothin' but salt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:39.84,1:28:42.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,至少那条路 我们也许能够…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At least that way, y'know we might be able to...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:44.16,1:28:44.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,共同\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Together...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:47.04,1:28:48.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,得到某种救赎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come across some kind of redemption.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:19.84,1:29:20.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,战车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}War rig!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:21.50,1:29:23.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是战车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's the war rig!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:33.08,1:29:34.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:34.81,1:29:36.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们为什么回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why are they going back?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:36.56,1:29:37.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们想投降吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do they wish to surrender?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:39.12,1:29:40.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们在朝峡谷开去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They are heading for the canyon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:42.37,1:29:44.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们想回末日堡垒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're going back to the citadel!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:45.41,1:29:47.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们知道那里毫无防备\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They know it's undefended!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:47.54,1:29:48.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,混帐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bullocks!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:50.02,1:29:51.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,上去 上去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Roll up! Roll up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:01.32,1:30:02.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:24.91,1:30:26.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你在做什么 - 祈祷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What are you doing? - I Praying.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:26.56,1:30:28.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 向谁祈祷 - 任何能聆听的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- To who? - Anyone that's listening.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:53.76,1:30:54.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,开始了 姑娘们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here we go, girls!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:57.29,1:30:58.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是我的车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's mine!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:03.09,1:31:05.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们想超到前面 刺穿我们的轮胎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He'll try to get in front of us, spike our wheels.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:12.33,1:31:13.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别弄坏引擎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't blow my engine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:14.08,1:31:14.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我去给它加把劲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna nudge him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:15.01,1:31:15.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一点点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just a little.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:29.18,1:31:31.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你个贱人 你背叛了他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You filth! You traitored him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:56.04,1:31:56.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,回去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:23.44,1:32:24.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们得减速了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Got to back off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:25.16,1:32:27.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一号引擎报废了 二号也快不行了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Engine one is gone. two's about to blow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:27.69,1:32:28.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:29.38,1:32:30.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是老手吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you a black thumb?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:31.30,1:32:32.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好的 去修一号引擎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right. Engine one now.{\r}
