Dialogue: 0,1:32:35.12,1:32:36.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们去解开油罐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll unhook the tanker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:48.84,1:32:50.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一枪解决一个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One man, one bullet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:07.58,1:33:08.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我看不见了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I cannot see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:08.44,1:33:10.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 玛蒂 玛蒂 - 我看不见了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Maadi! Maadi! - I cannot see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:50.04,1:33:50.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:51.26,1:33:53.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们有矛枪和尾犁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Harpoons and plows!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:53.24,1:33:54.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们在把我们向后拖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're hauling us back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:05.72,1:34:07.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,留三个螺栓 三个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Leave three bolts. Three.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:26.02,1:35:26.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:42.96,1:35:44.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你没事吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you okay?{\r}
