Dialogue: 0,1:36:39.74,1:36:40.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:50.44,1:36:51.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:51.65,1:36:52.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,留在我身边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay with me.{\r}
