Dialogue: 0,1:36:55.89,1:36:56.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你还活着吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey Are you there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:58.14,1:37:00.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你解决那个 我解决她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You finish that! I'll finish her!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:31.00,1:38:32.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,英灵殿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Valhalla!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:12.73,1:39:13.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一号引擎恢复了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Engine one's good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:14.40,1:39:14.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,暂时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:03.73,1:40:06.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她受伤了 她受了很重的伤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's hurt! She's hurt real bad!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:36.69,1:41:37.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你听见了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You hear that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:38.53,1:41:39.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,两辆八缸汽车会被炸飞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're gonna see two airborne V8s!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:41.58,1:41:42.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我需要你来开车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna need you to drive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:45.42,1:41:46.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我去解决他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll get him out of our way.{\r}
