Dialogue: 0,1:44:25.26,1:44:26.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:27.42,1:44:28.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,记得我吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remember me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:49.88,1:44:51.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's dead!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:51.61,1:44:52.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:11.70,1:45:12.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等你安全过去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When you're across safe,{\r}
