Dialogue: 0,1:47:14.46,1:47:16.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她在努力呼吸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's pumping air into her chest cavity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:17.02,1:47:20.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她每次呼吸 肺都在衰退\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's collapsing her lungs one breath at a time.{\r}
