Dialogue: 0,1:47:45.45,1:47:45.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:46.21,1:47:47.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:54.70,1:47:55.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:01.54,1:48:01.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}N-no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:02.21,1:48:03.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不 不 不 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, no. No, no, no, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:03.42,1:48:04.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她失血太多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's exsanguinated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:04.74,1:48:05.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,血都流光了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Drained all her blood.{\r}
